  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **ASTRA MILITARUM** as your **[Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction)**, **OFFICER** models with this ability may issue Orders. Each **OFFICER**'s datasheet sets its number of Orders per [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) and the units eligible to receive them.\n\nTo issue an Order:\n\n1. Choose an Order from the list below.\n2. Pick an eligible friendly unit up to 6\" from the issuing **OFFICER** model.\n\n**OFFICER** models give Orders during your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), and also at the close of any phase in which they got out of a **TRANSPORT** or were placed on the battlefield.\n\nHow Orders work:\n\n- An Order affects its unit until your next Command phase starts.\n- Unless a rule specifies otherwise, a unit keeps only one Order, and a later Order supersedes the earlier one.\n- **[Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)** units cannot be issued Orders, and an Order stops affecting a unit that becomes Battle-shocked.\n- Only the **ASTRA MILITARUM** models in the unit benefit.\n\nThe Orders:\n\n- **MOVE! MOVE! MOVE!**: +3\" Move.\n- **FIX BAYONETS!**: melee weapons improve their Weapon Skill by 1.\n- **TAKE AIM!**: ranged weapons improve their Ballistic Skill by 1.\n- **FIRST RANK, FIRE! SECOND RANK, FIRE!**: Rapid Fire weapons improve their Attacks by 1.\n- **TAKE COVER!**: Save improves by 1, but not past 3+.\n- **DUTY AND HONOUR!**: Leadership and Objective Control improve by 1.",
